      "writtenOn": "2024-10-15T00:30:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How are we getting these apex-specific PackagingSpecs? There shouldn\u0027t be any apex variants of apps in the `deps` property.\n\nIf `collectPackagingSpecs` is traversing through apexes and also getting the packagingSpecs of things that were already packaged into the apex, that\u0027s a problem.",
      "parentUuid": "c1704bb8_42b3b289",
      "revId": "3175e0f5de1a82c91e7831dfcfdd657b7a3509a6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
