      "writtenOn": "2024-10-15T01:28:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think apexes should use `IsPackagingItem()` / `PackagingItemAlwaysDepTag` instead of `InstallDepNeeded()`.",
      "parentUuid": "2162807a_55d836b6",
      "revId": "3175e0f5de1a82c91e7831dfcfdd657b7a3509a6",
